<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Black Sorrow (VIVINOS - ALNST Original Soundtrack Part.4)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PARK BYEONG HOON</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Black Sorrow (VIVINOS - ALNST Original Soundtrack Part.4)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6ZKajrGrRN4SU87tPVmSv4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.250" end="00:26.450">질척한 어둠 웅크린 모습</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.450" end="00:31.950">고개를 저어도 늘 같은 자리</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.950" end="00:38.860">닿지 않는 너, 나 홀로 상상을 해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.860" end="00:46.580">빛이 나는 너, 옆에 선 나</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.580" end="00:51.820">So black, black as it can be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.820" end="00:58.520">다가가면 갈수록 깊어지는 dark sea</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.520" end="01:01.830">Like a black, black sorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.830" end="01:05.080">A story of such woe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.080" end="01:10.330">이 이야기의 끝에는 피로 물든</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.330" end="01:16.020">시린 자리와 텅빈 공기뿐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.020" end="01:24.020" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.200" end="01:29.920">너의 눈길이 닿는 곳에</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.920" end="01:33.430">네 손끝 스칠 곳에</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.430" end="01:39.980">하염없이 너만을 기다리고</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.980" end="01:43.670">검은 어둠 속 붉은 빛</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.670" end="01:47.750">모래시계를 돌려</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.750" end="01:55.750">긴 시간을 너와</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.490" end="02:02.030">So black, black as it can be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.030" end="02:08.670">다가가면 갈수록 깊어지는 dark sea</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.670" end="02:11.860">Like a black, black sorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.860" end="02:15.050">A story of such woe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.050" end="02:20.330">이 이야기의 끝에는 피로 물든</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.330" end="02:23.350">시린 자리와 텅빈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.350" end="02:28.650">Such black, black sorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.650" end="02:33.500">그리고 너</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.500" end="02:38.800">언제나 나에겐 너 black sorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.800" end="02:41.260" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.260" end="02:47.970">나에겐 너 black sorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.970" end="02:50.810">나에겐 너 black sorrow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.810" end="02:54.810" /></div></body></tt>